Why?
SQS lets us decouple components and process work asynchronously.
We'll eventually have:
API Gateway
     ↓
Lambda
     ↓
SQS
     ↓
Another Lambda
     ↓
DynamoDB

This is a very important event-driven/serverless pattern

HANDSON:
Go to:
AWS Console → SQS → Create queue
Choose:
Standard
Name:
InterviewQueue

Leave the other settings at their defaults.
Create it.
